@broadcast "Last Orders - Episode 1: The Tab"
@channel ksab_tv
@category comedy
@length 180
@type scripted

::actors
@actor npc_lo_dez
@billing npc_lo_dez Dez Orme
@actor npc_lo_moss
@billing npc_lo_moss Moss
@actor npc_lo_rook
@billing npc_lo_rook Rook
@actor npc_lo_ida
@billing npc_lo_ida Ida
::endactors

::asset last_orders_logo
 _      ___   ____ _____    ___  ____  ____  _____ ____  ____
| |    / _ \ / ___|_   _|  / _ \|  _ \|  _ \| ____|  _ \/ ___|
| |   | |_| |\___ \ | |   | | | | |_) | | | |  _| | |_) \___ \
| |___|  _  | ___) || |   | |_| |  _ <| |_| | |___|  _ < ___) |
|_____|_| |_||____/ |_|    \___/|_| \_\____/|_____|_| \_\____/

                     Episode 1: "The Tab"
::endasset

::scene TITLE

EVENT FADE_IN

TITLE last_orders_logo

3s

::scene COLD OPEN

CAM 1 WIDE

NPC npc_lo_dez
NPC npc_lo_moss
NPC npc_lo_rook
NPC npc_lo_ida

ACTION npc_lo_dez polishes a glass.

Moss:
Usual, Dez.

Dez Orme:
Your usual is a tab, Moss.

ACTION npc_lo_moss leans on the bar.

Moss:
And it's never let me down.

EVENT LAUGHTER

ACTION npc_lo_rook bangs on the jukebox.

Rook:
Dez, it's playing the same song again.

Dez Orme:
It only knows the one. Same as Moss.

EVENT LAUGHTER

::scene THE TAB

CAM 4 MEDIUM on Moss

ACTION npc_lo_dez reads the ledger.

Dez Orme:
Four hundred and twelve credits.

Moss:
Round it down.

Dez Orme:
To what?

Moss:
Nothing. It's a nice round number.

EVENT LAUGHTER

CAM 2 MEDIUM on Ida

ACTION npc_lo_ida sips her gin.

Ida:
I'll pay it.

Moss:
Ida, you're an angel.

Ida:
If he sings.

EVENT LAUGHTER

CAM 1 WIDE

ACTION npc_lo_moss looks at the jukebox.

Moss:
Sing what?

Ida:
Whatever that thing's playing. It's been the same song since nineteen days ago.

Rook:
Nobody knows the words, Ida.

Ida:
He's had four hundred and twelve credits to learn them.

EVENT LAUGHTER

::scene THE SONG

CAM 3 MEDIUM on Rook

ACTION npc_lo_rook bangs on the jukebox.

Rook:
It's starting again. Go on, Moss.

ACTION npc_lo_moss dances.

Moss:
La la la. Something about a boat.

ACTION npc_lo_ida laughs.

Ida:
That's not the words.

Moss:
It's the tune, though.

EVENT LAUGHTER

ACTION npc_lo_dez pulls a pint.

Dez Orme:
I'll take two hundred for the tune.

ACTION npc_lo_dez slides the pint across the bar.

Moss:
And the other two hundred?

Dez Orme:
That's the words.

EVENT LAUGHTER

::scene TAG

CAM 4 MEDIUM on Moss

ACTION npc_lo_moss drinks his pint.

Moss:
Put this one on the tab, Dez.

ACTION npc_lo_dez wipes down the bar.

Dez Orme:
Four hundred and fifteen.

CAM 2 MEDIUM on Ida

ACTION npc_lo_ida dozes off.

Rook:
Ida's asleep.

Dez Orme:
Last orders, then.

Moss:
It's eleven in the morning.

CAM 1 WIDE

ACTION npc_lo_dez looks into the camera.

Dez Orme:
Not for you, it isn't.

EVENT APPLAUSE

CREDITS 10
LAST ORDERS

Taped in front of a live studio audience
at KSAB-TV, Coldwater
END_CREDITS

EVENT FADE_OUT

END
